{"id":"8dd004cf-0c52-401c-88ec-fef35ac6a588","object":"chat.completion","created":1785015112,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    word_token_indices = case['word_token_indices']\\n    word_scores = case['word_scores']\\n    forced_words = case['forced_words']\\n    token_budget = case['token_budget']\\n    \\n    n = len(word_token_indices)\\n    forced_set = set(forced_words)\\n    forced_cost = sum(len(word_token_indices[i]) for i in forced_set)\\n    remaining_indices = [i for i in range(n) if i not in forced_set]\\n    best_value = -1.0\\n    best_subset = []\\n    from itertools import combinations\\n    for r in range(len(remaining_indices) + 1):\\n        for combo in combinations(remaining_indices, r):\\n            cost = sum(len(word_token_indices[i]) for i in combo)\\n            if cost > token_budget - forced_cost:\\n                continue\\n            value = sum(word_scores[i] for i in combo)\\n            if value > best_value:\\n                best_value = value\\n                best_subset = list(combo)\\n    \\n    selected_words = sorted(list(forced_set) + best_subset)\\n    retained_tokens = []\\n    for i in selected_words:\\n        retained_tokens.extend(word_token_indices[i])\\n    retained_token_indices = sorted(set(retained_tokens))\\n    tokens_used = len(retained_tokens)\\n    return {\\n        \\\"retained_token_indices\\\": retained_token_indices,\\n        \\\"selected_words\\\": selected_words,\\n        \\\"tokens_used\\\": tokens_used\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to write a Python function solve(case) that takes a payload with fields: word_token_indices (list of lists of ints), word_scores (list of floats), forced_words (list of ints), token_budget (int). The goal is to select a subset of words such that total tokens used <= token_budget, maximize sum of word_scores, but forced_words must be included. Then ret